# Play test of the plan 'Raft 2 - The Drowned Frontier' (CIPlay plan_raft2, in a test world 'CI ...'): the story from
# its start without Raft's islands - the first island's coordinates come at the start, each one after it once the one
# before is done; each is tuned to on the Receiver and played to its end with its own test.
plan Raft 2 - The Drowned Frontier
expect chain beacon unlocked
expect chain RadioTower locked
tune beacon
include frontier_beacon.play
expect chain beacon done
expect chain ferry unlocked
tune ferry
include saltmarsh_ferry.play
expect chain ferry done
tune cinder
include cinderfall.play
expect chain cinder done
tune archive
include sunken_archive.play
expect chain archive done
tune harbor
include hightide_harbor.play
expect chain harbor done
tune graveyard
include iron_graveyard.play
expect chain graveyard done
tune spire
include storm_spire.play
expect chain spire done
tune whiteout
include whiteout_reach.play
expect chain whiteout done
tune gate
include drowned_gate.play
expect chain gate done
tune frontier
include the_frontier.play
expect chain frontier done
expect blueprints
plan end
